fwdEps":null,"peg":null,"grossMargins":0,"summary":"Aditya Forge Limited is engaged in the manufacturing and exporting of seamless butt-weld fittings and forged flanges. The company produces steel flanges and carbon steel butt-welded fittings using stainless steel and carbon steel as primary raw materials, with products made in accordance with international standards such as ANSI, ASME, and BS. It maintains quality control throughout the manufacturing process and provides products with original mill certificates for physical properties, chemical composition, and heat treatment. The company supplies these products to industrial clients and importers that require steel flanges and butt-weld fittings, including those adhering to foreign standard specifications, serving clients in various countries, including American and European markets. The company was founded in 1992 and is based in Vadodara, India.","employees":null,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795613548},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795613548,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Aditya Forge\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"Aditya Forge logs zero revenue in FY26; profit at ₹13.05 lakh","s":"scanx.trade","d":1794010417,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPeE9PMnhfSFBJMk44YWNFSFV6SDhUNHlkUlROdjctNUVycWpJVU9XWkE3Rk1ZNG4zYUZwNlFaVU5nOWdrSkFiNi1OdWVKZ2p6ZkpiNkxkWEhnU3NQSVpsMDg4cjF6MTBjbFJ6N0k3UVI0aVRTY2k0dEF4RmgxdndYOV9tTVBMVXdMZWRlSmlTM2NuektsS2k5MDVTOVJpcmtUNmpBOEQ0MXc4cFJrUWFvWWdOa05id0J4REE?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Q2 Results Today, November 5: Bharti Airtel, LIC, Titan, M&M, ONGC, Bharat Forge among companies to announce earnings - Full list","s":"ET Now","d":1793865600,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Aditya Forge changes secretarial auditor name to Prasad and Partners","s":"scanx.trade","d":1790233200,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOaElQeTFONFNuVDk2UHNzV2JqNkJ2